@Haroenv I checked it but it is an example to filter only by one date. Is there any example to filter by date when the data is an array of start and end dates? Or another structure to fix this problem? Thanks!

```js
const dates = [
  {
    start: "2023-06-10",
    end: "2023-06-20"
  },
  {
    start: "2023-06-25",
    end: "2023-07-10"
  },
  // More dates...
]
```
